

--> Log Levels (Low → High)
    | Level | Use                        |
    | ----- | -------------------------- |
    | TRACE | Very detailed (rare)       |
    | DEBUG | Developer debugging        |
    | INFO  | Application flow           |
    | WARN  | Unexpected but recoverable |
    | ERROR | Failure / Exception        |


--> Default Levels in Spring Boot
    Root: INFO
    Spring framework: INFO / WARN

--> Logging & Performance
    DEBUG/TRACE in production
    File logging too much
    Proper log level = better performance
